ite, mientras que diciembre supone el 10 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 24 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.667,80 euros, se adjudicó en octubre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no implica malas prácticas. Puede deberse a factores como precios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No se puede inferir actos ilícitos solo por la proximidad al límite.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1], [2], [3] atienden necesidades similares. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en otros ámbitos. Analizar si los contratos al límite coinciden con presupuestos cerrados o fechas específicas.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 37 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 11.4 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 3.2, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.1 to 5.0. December accounts for 11% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 10% of all its services and supplies contracts. The contracts just under the limit are spread across 24 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,667.80 euros, was awarded in October 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The data shows that some contracts are just under the limit, but it doesn't prove any wrongdoing. Prices could be lower than expected, or budgets might be fixed. This is a statistical trend, not evidence of improper actions.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of the contracts to see if they align with the body's needs. Review the awardee A's contracts to see if they repeat the same service or product. Look at the distribution of contracts across different sectors to identify any patterns.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["FZnLEROuRxhJ8Trn0ZPzLw%3D%3D","oraRQ6OnYXsl5NjlNci%2BtA%3D%3D","6JIrhWhulYzI8aL3PRS10Q%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-16"}}